  "rename_policy": "Heart Gloom both constructors alter Rungof name/rarity/talents only. Six prefixes preserve same body. Exact per-Rungof alias with constructor/provenance fields; no other unique prefix opt-in.",
  "appearance_policy": "Uniques with define_as bind exactly; no define_as is invented for pool uniques. Shader, moddable paper-dolls and extra composites stay native. Shade unique_glow unsupported. Phoenix PHOENIX_EGG changes image; egg remains native and bird token restores on deactivation. Native shader auras and particles are separate from actor shader.",
  "random_boss_policy": "Reuse existing captureRandomOrigin/recordRandomOrigin for verified unique bodies, including tall unique precedent; no arbitrary renamed unique admission. Unique temporal clones remain native under existing generic policy.",
  "summon_policy": "Queen Ant and Khulmanar summons/escorts draw separate pool bodies; Ninandra summons weaver young/escorts patriarchs. Grgglck tentacle and AkGishil animated blades are separate identities outside UA. Gorbat summons separate rimebark/ritch bodies. No escorts or tactical state baked in art."
}
